      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.73739624023438,
        111.76898193359375,
        513.416259765625,
        125.396484375
      ],
      "text": "prevention and care services if living in settings with a medium or low",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.73739624023438,
        126.1669921875,
        195.94740295410156,
        139.79449462890625
      ],
      "text": "TB prevalence",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.73739624023438,
        146.2459716796875,
        478.594482421875,
        159.59747314453125
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation acknowledging resource implications, low",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.73739624023438,
        160.64398193359375,
        215.93438720703125,
        173.9954833984375
      ],
      "text": "quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        185.38046264648438,
        513.47412109375,
        198.80096435546875
      ],
      "text": "Guidelines for intensified tuberculosis case-finding and isoniazid preventive  Source:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        199.18045043945312,
        513.4280395507812,
        212.6009521484375
      ],
      "text": "therapy for people living with HIV in resource-constrained settings.  Geneva, World",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        212.98043823242188,
        249.2384033203125,
        226.40093994140625
      ],
      "text": "(6) Health Organization, 2011",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        237.78591918945312,
        513.4395751953125,
        251.2064208984375
      ],
      "text": "Remark a: (7, 10)  The Panel considered recent evidence   that was not published at",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        251.58590698242188,
        513.451171875,
        265.00640869140625
      ],
      "text": "Guidelines for intensified tuberculosis  the time of the development of the 2011",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        265.3858947753906,
        510.1849060058594,
        278.806396484375
      ],
      "text": "case-finding and isoniazid preventive therapy for people living with HIV in resource-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        279.1858825683594,
        513.4395141601562,
        292.60638427734375
      ],
      "text": "constrained settings (6) . The Panel noted that this large, prospective, randomized,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        293.05487060546875,
        414.29791259765625,
        306.4063720703125
      ],
      "text": "controlled trial did not show any benefit of primary prophylaxis.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        317.7913513183594,
        510.28839111328125,
        331.21185302734375
      ],
      "text": "Remark b:  Reviewing the original trial that was the basis for the 2011 recommenda-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        331.5913391113281,
        513.3934326171875,
        345.0118408203125
      ],
      "text": "(6) tions   and that showed the benefit of primary prophylaxis, the Panel found that it",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        345.4603271484375,
        510.1963806152344,
        358.81182861328125
      ],
      "text": "represented an epidemiological context that may not be widely representative (com-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        359.26031494140625,
        513.47412109375,
        372.61181640625
      ],
      "text": "ing from one of the highest TB burden settings). In addition, the Panel noted that",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        373.060302734375,
        513.3704223632812,
        386.41180419921875
      ],
      "text": "the epidemiological context of that trial predated the introduction of ART in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        386.86029052734375,
        513.4166259765625,
        400.2117919921875
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV, and would therefore not be representative of the situation in 2013.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        400.6602783203125,
        513.3704833984375,
        414.01177978515625
      ],
      "text": "Finally, that study had been stopped early, following interim analysis. There was also",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        414.46026611328125,
        513.4625244140625,
        427.811767578125
      ],
      "text": "an acknowledged difficulty in interpreting the study: the reduced mortality reported",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        428.26025390625,
        380.637451171875,
        441.61175537109375
      ],
      "text": "was not a reduction in deaths attributed primarily to TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        453.0657653808594,
        513.4164428710938,
        466.4172668457031
      ],
      "text": "These findings were discussed in a subsequent conference call between the Panel",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        466.8657531738281,
        513.462646484375,
        480.2172546386719
      ],
      "text": "of this guidance and the Panel of the 2011 guidelines; both Panels suggested that",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        480.6657409667969,
        513.382080078125,
        494.0172424316406
      ],
      "text": "the original recommendation, from the 2011 document, should be split into two",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        494.4657287597656,
        287.9819030761719,
        507.8172302246094
      ],
      "text": "separate recommendations as above.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        519.271240234375,
        513.4163818359375,
        532.6227416992188
      ],
      "text": "In high TB prevalence settings, 6 months of IPT may have additional benefits to",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        533.0712280273438,
        513.496826171875,
        546.4227294921875
      ],
      "text": "that of ART in protecting against TB. However, in settings with a medium to low",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        546.8712158203125,
        513.4625244140625,
        560.2227172851562
      ],
      "text": "prevalence of TB, IPT might be offered considering resource implications. The Panel",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        560.6712036132812,
        314.17889404296875,
        574.022705078125
      ],
      "text": "recommended further research in this area.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        585.4766845703125,
        513.41650390625,
        598.8281860351562
      ],
      "text": "WHO recommends symptom-based screening, which is presented schematically in",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        599.2766723632812,
        145.4969024658203,
        612.628173828125
      ],
      "text": "Figure 3.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
